OL,3,GNEWSAScottish colleges need #2.5bn
OL,4,Ainvestment boost by 2037, report warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FColleges in Scotland will need #2.5bn
OL,7,Fto meet required investment in their
OL,8,Finfrastructure over the next decade,
OL,9,Faccording to a new report.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Funding Council (SFC)
OL,12,Festimated #1.3bn was needed to maintain
OL,13,Fthe college estate to a good standard,
OL,14,Fwhile an additional #1.2bn would be
OL,15,Frequired to fund improvements.
OL,17,FThe College Infrastructure Investment
OL,18,FPlan (College IIP) said the "condition,
OL,19,Fconfiguration and expense" of some
OL,20,Ffurther and higher education buildings
OL,21,Fmeant they were "no longer fit for
OL,22,Fpurpose".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
