OL,3,GNEWSAScottish colleges need #2.5bn
OL,4,Ainvestment boost by 2037, report warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FColleges Scotland chief executive,
OL,7,FGavin Donoghue, said the report laid
OL,8,Fbare the "scale of the challenge"
OL,9,Ffacing the sector.
